# The order Arcadia's changes go into the Chromium tree (docs/engine-build.md › "The patch series").
# The tree is plain Chromium with ungoogled-chromium and domain substitution; CEF's own patches are gone, but for
# the few ArcadiaCore relies on (chromium-cef-carryover.patch).
#
#   chromium <patch>  a patch to chromium/src, after ungoogled-chromium and domain substitution (step 4)
#   layer <dir>       our own files, copied in by <dir>/apply.sh (engine/<layer>/src mirrors chromium/src)
#
# Lines run top to bottom; a patch is made against the tree as every line above it leaves it.
# One concern per patch, named for it; a new patch goes where it belongs, not where its name sorts.

# CEF's patches to Chrome whose behaviour ArcadiaCore relies on (each hunk's origin is in the patch's header).
chromium chromium-cef-carryover.patch
chromium chromium-autofill-address-bubble-window.patch
chromium chromium-device-chooser-hook.patch
chromium chromium-cast-dialog-hook.patch
chromium chromium-side-panel-hook.patch
chromium chromium-hidden-window-current-window.patch
chromium chromium-devtools-redock-display.patch
chromium chromium-devtools-window-title.patch
chromium chromium-extension-install-prompt-hook.patch
chromium chromium-extension-updates.patch
chromium chromium-extension-window-hidden.patch
chromium chromium-neterror-mascot.patch
chromium chromium-branding.patch
chromium chromium-icloud-keychain-window.patch
# Load-bearing for every user's data: the Safe Storage item ("Arcadia Safe Storage" / "Arcadia") holds the key to
# their saved passwords and cookies. It must survive any re-sync (plain Chromium for ArcadiaCore, a version bump), unchanged.
chromium chromium-safe-storage-name.patch
chromium chromium-password-bubble-hook.patch
chromium chromium-password-generation-local.patch
chromium chromium-tab-strip-notify-before-insert.patch
chromium chromium-ui-update-before-insert.patch
chromium chromium-window-docked-devtools.patch
chromium chromium-window-hosted.patch
chromium chromium-extension-installed-bubble.patch
chromium chromium-pip-close-keeps-playing.patch
chromium chromium-pip-overlay-window.patch
chromium chromium-tab-sharing-capturer.patch
chromium chromium-arcadia-layer.patch

layer engine/chromium
layer engine/arcadiacore
